Depends: zenity | garma, bubblewrap, policykit-1 | pkexec | polkit-1 | polkit, systemd, procps, coreutils, fuse-overlayfs, xz-utils | xz, zstd, gpgv, tar, libnotify-bin, curl, aria2, xdg-user-dirs, bash
