Section: misc
Conflicts: ace-host-integration
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://gitee.com/amber-ce/amber-pm/
Description: Amber Package Manager with native (apt-free) package management
 APM installs and runs Debian-based applications inside bwrap/overlayfs
 environments. Since 2.0.0 packages are managed natively from the apt-style
 APM repository (signed index + .deb payloads) without requiring dpkg/apt or a
 bundled management rootfs.
